From 325803d16923eb7baf9dcf859d9a373499d1060a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A2Tools-patch <patch@localhost>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 19:19:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Plugins: the monsters fought now with their HP
 (events:combat)

A plugin with the new permission events:combat hears "combat": the
monsters hit in the last 20 s and alive, with their NPC code, name, HP
and max HP as the meter reads them for its boss bar, bosses first. At
most four times a second while it changes, every two seconds during a
fight, once empty when it is over. For the Boss Notes plugin: its
phases by the boss's HP.
